                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/416: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-10-16T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                                1926—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>233. Your 479, October 14, 3 p.m., 483 October 15, 1 p.m. Department approves
                    action taken as stated in your 479, paragraph 1.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
